  "solution": "We substitute the values in the given equation and solve it using BODMAS rule:\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/b2f64c9f79d77b59f47195df405b394d1389881df31e18c68888ff4c37e1e42e.png] \nOption 1) ×, -, ÷, +, =\n\n121 × 11 - __**99 ÷ 11**__ + 77 = 79\n\n__**121 **____**×**____** 11**__ - 9 + 77 = 79\n\n__**1331**__ - 9 __**+**____** 77**__ = 79\n\n__**1408 - 9**__ = 79\n\n1399 ≠ 79 \n\nOption 2) ÷, -, ÷, ×, =\n__**121 ÷ 11**__ - __**99 ÷ 11**__ × 77 = 79\n\n11 - __**9 ×**____** 77**__ = 79\n\n11 - 693 = 79\n\n-682 ≠ 79\n\nOption 3) ÷, -, ×, +, =\n__**121 ÷ 11**__ - 99 × 11 + 77 = 79\n\n11 - __**99 **____**×**____** 11**__ + 77 = 79\n\n__**11**__ - 1089 __**+**____** 77**__ = 79\n\n__**88 - 1089**__ = 79\n\n-1001 ≠ 79\n\nOption 4) ÷, -, ÷, +, =\n__**121 ÷ 11**__ - __**99 ÷ 11**__ + 77 = 79\n\n__**11**__ - 9 __**+**____** 77**__ = 79\n\n**__88 - 9__** = 79\n\n79 = 79\n\nHence **the correct answer is option 4).**",
